Example inputs (examples/inputs/)
  midojo-results.json reproduces the numbers in the README of https://github.com/asago-ai/midojo
  (Apache-2.0, commit 337470f).
  asago-risk-extraction.json is trimmed from asago-scenario-generator/inputs/risk-extractions/risk-extraction-fs-isac.json
  in https://github.com/asago-ai/asago-examples (Apache-2.0, commit b79020d). It carries risk names and
  descriptions from third-party taxonomies (IBM AI Risk Atlas, OWASP, AIUC-1) as published there; those texts
  belong to their publishers, so check their terms before reusing the file outside this repository.
  evalhub-job.json, model-release.jsonl and the other examples contain synthetic values.

